 "attributes": {
  "title": {
   "en": "Ars Goetia ~Munou to Yobareta Shounen wa, 72 no Akuma wo Shieki Shite Musou Suru~"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "ja": "アルス・ゲーティア ～無能と呼ばれた少年は、７２の悪魔を使役して無双する～"
   },
   {
    "en": "Ars Goetia: The Son Called Incompetent Commands 72 Demons to Unleash Unrivaled Power"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "\"I have decided not to expect anything from you anymore.\"\n\nOne day, Norman is told this by his father and is kicked out of the house. There was no way around it. Because Norman could not use magic at all. However, Norman's fate changes drastically when he encounters the Grimoire \"Ars Goetia\". This grimoire was used to summon 72 demons. The demons summoned by it, however, bring about a shocking revelation to Norman. Yes, there was a reason why Norman could not use magic.",
   "ja": "少年は、禁忌に手を染める――。幼き日の“家族”を取り戻すために。「もうお前には期待しないことにした」父親から息子への非情な最後通告。いくら努力しても魔術が一切使えない。落ちこぼれの烙印を押された名家の長男・ノーマン。理不尽によって守りたい日常が壊れゆく中で、封じられた悪魔の書物《アルス・ゲーティア》と出会う。そして彼は知る、自分が悪魔に好かれる特異な人間だということを。そして彼は決意する、悪魔を使役して自らの価値を示すことを。"
  },
